0..73 Comment "// Reflexivity is a unit of `then` beside a stuck transport and beside an"
74..99 Comment "// action on reflexivity."
100..102 Comment "//"
103..178 Comment "// A coherence proved by path induction reaches its base case through these"
179..239 Comment "// units, so the kernel re-derives what the checker accepts."
240..242 Comment "//"
243..317 Comment "// The associator is a transport along a variable path, so it stays stuck."
318..386 Comment "// The action of a function on reflexivity reduces to reflexivity. A"
387..463 Comment "// composite whose operand runs and sticks waits on its path, so a whiskered"
464..538 Comment "// reflexivity after the associator reduces before the associator unfolds."
539..541 Comment "//"
542..596 Comment "// - see: #3734 — the kernel\'s replay of these units"
597..650 Comment "// - see: `then.gandr` — the composite of two paths"
651..713 Comment "// - see: `transport-dependent.gandr` — based path induction"
